   "source": [
    "### 2. Query the catalog"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "84435c1d-40bd-440e-b6bd-a4d30d0b21db",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Query a large amount of products to identify those affected by RFI. The typical filters of STAC can be used (by location, time, ids, etc.). Working with L1A data is prefered."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3881dc0d-4419-4604-8847-a087e42e7482",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2.1 Search in the catalog"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "78e71c95-578d-42bd-afbb-41cdcc7a0d30",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Accessing 200 items (limited by max_items).\n",
      "124302 items found that matched the query.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "catalog_url = 'https://catalog.maap.eo.esa.int/catalogue/'\n",
    "catalog = Client.open(catalog_url)\n",
    "\n",
    "bbox_antarctica    = [-180, -90, 180, -60]\n",
    "bbox_asia = [25.0, -11.0, 180.0, 82.0]\n",
    "\n",
    "search = catalog.search(\n",
    "    collections = [\"BiomassLevel1a\"],\n",
    "    datetime = ['2026-01-01T00:00:00Z','2026-07-01T23:59:59Z'],\n",
    "    bbox = bbox_asia,\n",
    "    max_items = 200,\n",
    "    limit = 2000,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "items = list(search.items())\n",
    "print(f\"Accessing {len(items)} items (limited by max_items).\")\n",
    "print(f\"{search.matched()} items found that matched the query.\")"
   ]
  },
